        "created_at": "2025-09-28T02:51:43.959Z",
        "cooked": "<p>When you’re studying at an IIT, there’s no such thing as ‘out of syllabus‘.  The only way to solve this is to “get used to that“.  In the overall scheme of things, it’s a good thing…you’ll realize it sooner or later.</p>\n<p><span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#Edit</span>.  For the parts not dealt with already in the lectures, live sessions might help; in case your questions still remain unanswered, ask in discourse, refer to the suggested text books, and in general, the resources from the internet - videos, articles, books etc.</p>",
